# Structure

```txt
app/         → Expo Router routes
assets/      → static assets
components/  → reusable UI
constants/   → constants and config
contexts/    → global state
hooks/       → UI/state integration
queries/     → React Query definitions
services/    → external communication
usecases/    → business logic and orchestration (optional)
utils/       → utility functions
```

# Architecture

- Keep routes lightweight
- Avoid API calls inside screens/components
- Prefer React Query for async/server state
- Use Context only for global state
- Avoid heavy logic inside hooks
- Keep services focused on external communication
- Keep usecases framework-agnostic
- Only introduce a usecase when business rules or orchestration are required

## Recommended flow

Simple operations:

```txt
Screen/Route
    ↓
Hook
    ↓
Query
    ↓
Service
```

Operations with business logic:

```txt
Screen/Route
    ↓
Hook
    ↓
Query
    ↓
Usecase
    ↓
Service
```
